2. Establish the Performance Critical Path

Classify operations into:

Critical business path

Operations that must complete before the business transaction can continue.

Non-critical path

Operations that can safely execute asynchronously.

For example:

                    BUSINESS PATH
                         │
              ┌──────────┴──────────┐
              │                     │
           DB Update            Business Logic
              │                     │
              └──────────┬──────────┘
                         │
                    Transaction
                         │
                         ▼
                    Completion
                         
