                    │
          ┌─────────┴─────────┐
          ▼                   ▼
      Audit Queue         Kafka Queue
          │                   │
          ▼                   ▼
      Audit Workers       Kafka Producer

Determine which audit events genuinely require synchronous durability.

Do not assume every audit event needs to block the transaction.

