4. Introduce an Asynchronous Audit Pipeline

Where business requirements permit, implement:

Business Transaction
        │
        ├──► Audit Channel
        │
        ▼
Business Completion
Audit Channel
        │
        ▼
Audit Worker
        │
        ▼
Batch
        │
        ▼
Database

Prefer:

Channel<AuditEvent>

with bounded capacity.

Example:

Channel.CreateBounded<AuditEvent>(
    new BoundedChannelOptions(10000)
    {
        FullMode = BoundedChannelFullMode.Wait,
        SingleWriter = false,
        SingleReader = false
    });

Do not introduce an unbounded audit queue.

